{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49420","headline":"生查子 一 · 牛希济","name":"生查子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春山烟欲收，天澹星稀小。\n残月脸边明，别泪临清晓。\n语已多，情未了，回首犹重道。\n记得绿罗帬，处处怜芳草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}